// Pilot's Handbook of Aeronautical Knowledge, FAA-H-8083-25C, chapter 15 (airspace): https://www.faa.gov/regulations_policies/handbooks_manuals/aviation/faa-h-8083-25c.pdf
// Private Pilot Airplane ACS, FAA-S-ACS-6C, PA.I.E and PA.III.A: https://www.faa.gov/training_testing/testing/acs/private_airplane_acs_6.pdf
