// FAA From the Flight Deck, Rocky Mountain Metropolitan (BJC): tower 0600L to 2200L daily, Class D partly under Denver Class B: https://www.faa.gov/flight_deck/pilot_info/bjc.pdf
// Federal Register 2024-30530 (Dec. 23, 2024), Centennial Class D amended, surface to but not including 8,000 feet MSL, effective Feb. 20, 2025:
